<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou art our Counsel of defense,</l><l>The Pleader of our case,</l><l>Our Interceder for all things,</l><l>Our Helper in all ways.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, Thou dost manage all affairs</l><l>For us in God’s delight,</l><l>Both in the heavens and in us</l><l>With power in Thy right.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou intercedest all the time,</l><l>Lord Spirit, with Thy grace,</l><l>In heav’n to plead, in us to groan,</l><l>Entreating in our place.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thou helpest as the living One,</l><l>And attest by God’s plan</l><l>In resurrection pow’r of life,</l><l>Empow’ring our inner man.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Thou, as the Spirit giving life,</l><l>In weakness dost sustain;</l><l>And in our spirit with Thy strength,</l><l>Our being dost maintain.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Thou servest ever with Thyself,</l><l>In mercy and in love,</l><l>That Thou may be our all in all,</l><l>And we Thy fulness prove.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
